{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は 代々木第一体育館で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"日テレ HALLOWEEN LIVEでした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくれた皆さんありがとうっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"仮装は"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"天使でした！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"むしろ 神様感凄かったけど...ゼウス！！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"つまりは、そう、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早くも 10月が終わります。なんだって！？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"驚きしかない、秋どこー！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬嫌いじゃないけど"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒さだけはやめてほしいなぁ...泣"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あと前回のブログの絵が好評で"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めっちゃ嬉しかったなんて言えない。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当 嬉しかったなんて言え..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/28/5990040/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/28/5990040/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"芸術の秋！ということで"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"るぅちゃんが出演してる"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"舞台 GrandStageを観劇しに行きましたっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"懐かしの風紀委員(ヴァンパイア騎士)です♪*"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yumi.wakatsuki/img/blog/yumi.wakatsuki/img/2016/10/28/5990040/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久々に彼女の2.5次元の姿を見ましたが"